{"body": "This removes the planner pool from ParallelIterable, which was used to\nsubmit all of the iterable tasks in parallel. This was used to queue\nup tasks to read every manifest in a snapshot. However, when a caller\nstopped reading early, all tasks would still run and add results to the\nqueue.\nNow, tasks are submitted from the thread consuming the iterator as it\nruns hasNext. If the caller stops consuming the iterator, then no new\ntasks are submitted. This also keeps track of the submitted tasks and\nwill cancel them when the iterator is closed.", "date": "2018-12-11T00:42:13Z", "hash": "sha256:4b68d06b91b8ec0708c0", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#45", "meta": {"additions": 92, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-01-16T16:29:53Z", "comments": 9, "deletions": 68, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/io/CloseableGroup.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/BaseTableScan.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/SystemProperties.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/util/ParallelIterable.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/util/ThreadPools.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/hadoop/TestHadoopCommits.java"], "merged_at": "2019-01-16T16:29:53Z", "merged_by": "danielcweeks", "n_files": 6, "number": 45, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2018-12-11T20:21:41Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T05:26:50Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T05:27:49Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T05:30:19Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T07:09:52Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T17:08:18Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-12T17:51:32Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-14T19:23:25Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-14T19:31:39Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-15T00:16:22Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-19T18:32:09Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-19T18:32:39Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-19T18:36:46Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-19T20:00:15Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-19T20:01:07Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-21T15:39:32Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2018-12-21T15:39:47Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2018-12-21T18:07:13Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-01-16T17:08:34Z"}, "people": ["rdblue"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Lazily submit tasks in ParallelIterable and add cancellation.", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/45"}
