{"body": "A manifest list is created for every commit attempt. Before this update,\nthe same file was used, which caused retries to fail trying to create\nthe same list file. This uses a new location for every manifest list,\nkeeps track of old lists, and cleans up unused lists after a commit\nsucceeds.", "date": "2018-12-12T19:23:15Z", "hash": "sha256:7f252eaab1eef5b4deed", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#48", "meta": {"additions": 46, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2018-12-13T21:18:38Z", "comments": 1, "deletions": 3, "draft": false, "files": ["core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/SnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TestFastAppend.java"], "merged_at": "2018-12-13T21:18:38Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 2, "number": 48, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2018-12-13T21:18:38Z"}, "people": ["rdblue"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Fix commit retry with manfiest lists.", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/48"}
